WEBVTT

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:10.369
[footfalls]

00:00:13.024 --> 00:00:14.721
Professor?

00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:17.942
It's good to see you,
Shadow.

00:00:18.116 --> 00:00:20.205
I knew you'd come home.

00:00:20.379 --> 00:00:22.947
I can't get her out of my head.

00:00:23.121 --> 00:00:24.644
The pain...

00:00:24.818 --> 00:00:26.167
It's too much.

00:00:26.341 --> 00:00:29.823
And that is why
we have to punish them.

00:00:34.349 --> 00:00:35.960
Okay, I don't like you
and you don't like me.

00:00:36.134 --> 00:00:37.962
Let's get this
over with quickly.

00:00:38.136 --> 00:00:39.964
Out of my way, dorkupine.

00:00:40.138 --> 00:00:42.227
"Dorkupine"?
Really clever.

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:48.537
[hollow tapping]

00:00:48.711 --> 00:00:50.800
This door is six-inch-thick
solid steel

00:00:50.975 --> 00:00:52.759
on a pressurized latch.

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:55.109
I'll need a moment to calculate
the molecular density

00:00:55.283 --> 00:00:56.893
and invert
the venting mechanics.

00:00:57.068 --> 00:00:58.504
[thunderous crash]

00:01:00.549 --> 00:01:01.811
[Knuckles] I unlocked it.

00:01:01.986 --> 00:01:04.989
[Robotnik] Subtle as always,
fist-for-brains.

00:01:06.251 --> 00:01:07.992
Easy, Shadow.

00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:10.646
Those are the guests
I've been expecting.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.475
Let's give them
a warm welcome.

00:01:17.305 --> 00:01:18.654
[Stone] Whoa.

00:01:18.828 --> 00:01:20.091
What is this place?

00:01:20.265 --> 00:01:22.223
[Sonic] It looks like
a military base,

00:01:22.397 --> 00:01:24.225
but nobody's been here
for years.

00:01:24.399 --> 00:01:25.792
I wonder if it's haunted.

00:01:25.966 --> 00:01:28.882
Haunted? Nobody said anything
about being haunted.

00:01:29.056 --> 00:01:32.016
What's the matter?
You afraid of g-g-g-ghosts?

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.279
Nothing scares
an Echidna warrior.

00:01:34.453 --> 00:01:36.846
Uh, yeah. Do you remember
what happened last movie night?

00:01:37.021 --> 00:01:38.587
[screaming in terror]

00:01:38.761 --> 00:01:40.067
[piercing scream][all yelling]

00:01:40.241 --> 00:01:41.677
Let go, let go, let go!

00:01:41.851 --> 00:01:44.550
There is no such thing
as a friendly ghost.

00:01:46.117 --> 00:01:47.640
[Sonic]
So which way do we go?

00:01:47.814 --> 00:01:51.513
I know! We should split up.

00:01:51.687 --> 00:01:54.908
Everyone with hideous,
brightly-colored fur
take the left and the middle.

00:01:55.082 --> 00:01:56.692
Stone and I will go right.

00:01:56.866 --> 00:01:58.607
No, no, no, no, no. I'm not
letting you out of my sight.

00:01:58.781 --> 00:02:00.566
Tails, you and Stone go left.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:03.830
Knuckles, you take the middle.
Eggman, you and me go right.

00:02:04.004 --> 00:02:05.919
By all means.

00:02:06.093 --> 00:02:07.573
We could use some
time together.

00:02:07.747 --> 00:02:09.357
To work on
your trust issues.

00:02:09.531 --> 00:02:12.360
You know what? You're right.
I should be more trusting.

00:02:12.534 --> 00:02:15.320
I mean, you've only tried
to kill me twice!

00:02:17.365 --> 00:02:19.585
Just a dark, creepy hallway.

00:02:19.759 --> 00:02:21.456
Nothing to be afraid of.

00:02:23.197 --> 00:02:24.894
You hear that, ghost?

00:02:25.069 --> 00:02:26.592
You don't frighten me!

00:02:26.766 --> 00:02:28.333
[steam hissing][yells]

00:02:31.075 --> 00:02:33.468
Get... a... grip.

00:02:34.382 --> 00:02:36.123
Boo.[screams]

00:02:38.821 --> 00:02:41.520
I'm just gonna
come right out and say this:

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.479
You're adorable.[chuckles]
Oh, um, thanks.

00:02:44.653 --> 00:02:48.092
So, what's it like
being Sonic's assistant?

00:02:48.266 --> 00:02:51.573
You have a daily routine?
Paid time off? Benefits?

00:02:51.747 --> 00:02:54.924
Oh, I'm not Sonic's assistant.
We're teammates.

00:02:55.099 --> 00:02:57.101
He's the leader,
Knuckles is the muscle,

00:02:57.275 --> 00:02:58.841
and I'm the gadget guy.

00:02:59.015 --> 00:03:00.365
We all have a role to play.

00:03:00.539 --> 00:03:02.280
That's what makes the team
so special!

00:03:02.454 --> 00:03:04.195
That and the fact
we're best friends.

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:06.240
You are?

00:03:06.414 --> 00:03:08.242
Well, yeah.
Just like you and Eggman, right?

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:12.116
Uh... Yeah, eh...

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.292
Of course! Yes.

00:03:14.466 --> 00:03:17.338
Me and the doctor,
best of friends.

00:03:18.818 --> 00:03:20.385
That's definitely
what we are.

00:03:20.559 --> 00:03:22.691
[metallic clattering]

00:03:22.865 --> 00:03:24.650
[squeaking]

00:03:25.607 --> 00:03:26.652
Hmm.

00:03:31.657 --> 00:03:33.398
[both screaming]

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:49.327
Whoa. Look at all this stuff.

00:03:49.501 --> 00:03:52.634
This was more than
just a military base or a lab.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.636
It was a home.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.377
People lived here.

00:03:56.986 --> 00:03:58.466
He had a family.

00:03:59.206 --> 00:04:01.034
Is that what I smell?

00:04:01.208 --> 00:04:04.298
The stench
of domestic harmony?

00:04:04.472 --> 00:04:07.997
You ever wonder what
your life would have been like
if you had a family?

00:04:08.172 --> 00:04:09.608
Hmm... No!

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:11.784
Maybe you wouldn't have gone
full supervillain.

00:04:11.958 --> 00:04:14.787
I have no parents,
no aunts, no uncles.

00:04:14.961 --> 00:04:17.485
And something about my attitude
renders me...

00:04:18.443 --> 00:04:22.577
undesirable
to all possible genders.

00:04:24.449 --> 00:04:26.625
My future is a cul-de-sac!

00:04:27.626 --> 00:04:29.628
The Robotnik name ends...

00:04:31.282 --> 00:04:32.935
<i>avec moi.</i>

00:04:33.109 --> 00:04:35.155
Yes, I know French.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.679
[shuddering spasm]

00:04:39.681 --> 00:04:40.769
Whoa.

00:04:40.943 --> 00:04:43.946
Is this where you grew up,
Shadow?

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.905
No wonder you're so mad.

00:04:46.079 --> 00:04:48.951
This place could really use
a beanbag chair

00:04:49.125 --> 00:04:50.431
and some comic books.

00:04:51.954 --> 00:04:53.173
What happened here?

00:04:53.869 --> 00:04:55.044
[hard grunt]

00:04:55.219 --> 00:04:57.351
I'm tired
of giving you warnings!

00:04:58.222 --> 00:05:00.224
[grunts, yells]

00:05:01.225 --> 00:05:02.617
Where'd you go, hedgehog?

00:05:02.791 --> 00:05:04.663
I wasn't finished
trauma dumping.

00:05:06.491 --> 00:05:09.276
My darlings!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.973
[inhales, giggles]

00:05:11.147 --> 00:05:13.585
My eggy weggies!

00:05:14.716 --> 00:05:17.763
[professor] <i>♪ Memories ♪</i>

00:05:17.937 --> 00:05:21.288
<i>♪ Light the corners ♪</i>

00:05:21.462 --> 00:05:25.118
<i>♪ Of my mind ♪</i>

00:05:25.292 --> 00:05:28.426
<i>♪ Misty watercolor ♪</i>

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:34.214
<i>♪ Memories ♪</i>

00:05:34.388 --> 00:05:37.261
<i>♪ Of the way ♪</i>

00:05:37.435 --> 00:05:42.701
<i>♪ We weren't ♪</i>

00:05:43.658 --> 00:05:44.659
I...

